Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.00,0:03:05.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《恶灵骑士》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:58.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据说西部是建立在传说上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's said that the West was built on legends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.79,0:01:02.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而传说协助我们解读超自然的事物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tall tales that help us make sense of things too great...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.76,0:01:05.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或骇人听闻的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}...or too terrifying to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.59,0:01:10.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是关于灵魂骑士的传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the legend of the Ghost Rider.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.17,0:01:24.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,传说中，每一代都会有一个灵魂骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Story goes that every generation has one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.38,0:01:28.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,受诅咒的灵魂，在人世间奔驰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some damned soul, cursed to ride the earth...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.85,0:01:32.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兑现魔鬼的契约\N{\fnArial\fs30}...collecting on the devil's deals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.16,0:01:40.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很多年前 有一个灵魂骑士被派去圣凡冈萨村\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many years ago, a Ghost Rider was sent to the village of San Venganza...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.13,0:01:46.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兑现一份上千条灵魂的恶魔契约\N{\fnArial\fs30}...to fetch a contract won'th 1000 evil souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.07,0:01:50.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但那份契约的力量太庞大\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that contract was so powerful...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.61,0:01:58.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他知道绝不能让恶魔得到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}...he knew he could never let the devil get his hands on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.75,0:02:03.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,于是，他做了一件灵魂骑士们从未做过的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he did what no Rider has ever done before:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.79,0:02:12.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他从恶魔手中逃脱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He outran the devil himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.13,0:02:19.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,传说最奇妙的地方在于…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing about legends is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.93,0:02:23.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时候，它们是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}...sometimes they're true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.15,0:03:13.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女士们，先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.46,0:03:17.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最惊险神奇的\N{\fnArial\fs30}...the amazing, blazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.93,0:03:21.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摩托车特技！\N{\fnArial\fs30}...stunt cycle spectacular!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.98,0:03:47.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请为巴顿和爆火强尼鼓掌吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about a big round of applause for Barton and Johnny Blaze?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.33,0:03:55.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我听听你们的掌声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hear it for them, folks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.08,0:04:10.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很拽呀，小子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a hotshot, ain't you, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.15,0:04:13.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乳臭未干的家伙，自以为无所不知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young, think you know everything there is to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.98,0:04:17.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自以为可以长生不老，是不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think you're gonna live forever. Is that about right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.39,0:04:20.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 拜托，老爸，我只是玩玩而已 - 问题不在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Dad. It was a patch of dirt. - That's not the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.89,0:04:25.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题是，我们才表演了不到一周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point is, we've been doing this act less than a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.73,0:04:27.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你却已经在鬼混了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're already screwing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.26,0:04:30.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我那么做只是为了观众 - 我很清楚你是为了谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was just doing it for the crowd. - We both know why you done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.80,0:04:37.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为你坐在轮椅上时她还会陪着你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think she's gonna stand by you when you're in a wheelchair?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.34,0:04:42.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你再拽呀！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh, hotshot?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.95,0:04:55.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,儿子，在生活中你做的每件事 每个选择都其结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son, everything you do in life, every choice you make has a consequence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.29,0:04:58.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做事不用大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you do things without thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.79,0:05:01.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只会被命运牵着走，而非自己去主导命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}...you ain't making the choice, the choice is making you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.46,0:05:04.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 明白吗？ - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You understand that? - Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.00,0:05:07.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.37,0:05:11.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说: “是的，先生”\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, "Yes, sir."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.34,0:05:47.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿，老爸 让我偶尔骑“葛瑞丝”去兜兜风，你觉得如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dad, you think maybe I could take Grace for a ride sometime?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.51,0:05:49.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得你是个 可以驾驭“葛瑞丝”的男子汉了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think you're man enough for Grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.38,0:05:51.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.18,0:05:54.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.65,0:05:58.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨，强尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.76,0:06:01.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨，罗珊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Roxie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.60,0:06:09.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.65,0:06:18.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(强尼和罗珊 天荒地老)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.39,0:06:34.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.03,0:06:39.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了，罗珊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong, Roxie?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.36,0:06:43.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.53,0:06:45.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.70,0:06:47.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸要把我送去跟我妈住\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad's sending me to live with my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.11,0:06:54.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么时候？ - 很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- When? - Soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.78,0:06:58.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.71,0:07:01.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说你配不上我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says you're not good enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.48,0:07:03.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只是一段插曲罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you're just a phase.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.32,0:07:07.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该怎么办，强尼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what are we gonna do, Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.03,0:07:15.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一起走，骑上摩托车远走高飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll leave. We'll jump on the bike and just keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.16,0:07:18.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你爸呢？表演呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what about your dad? What about the show?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.47,0:07:21.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不需要我，他不需要任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't need me. He doesn't need anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.40,0:07:25.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天中午，我们在这里会合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow, noon. We'll meet here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.56,0:07:45.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（父子飞越烈火）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.03,0:08:31.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（癌细胞已经扩散）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.42,0:08:52.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几点了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.93,0:08:54.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.21,0:09:11.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要去哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.92,0:09:16.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪都不去，老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nowhere, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.12,0:09:19.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我哪都不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.12,0:09:54.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差太远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Far out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.23,0:10:04.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 爆火强尼 - 是的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Johnny Blaze. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.07,0:10:06.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我今天看了你的表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caught your show today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.04,0:10:12.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来是想告诉你，我很欣赏你的骑术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wanted to tell you how much I enjoyed watching you ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.47,0:10:13.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦，谢谢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.07,0:10:16.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许有一天你会为我骑车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you'd ride for me one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.21,0:10:18.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也是排节目的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You run a show?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.15,0:10:21.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世上最好的节目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greatest show on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.49,0:10:28.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢，不必了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, but no thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.66,0:10:35.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了，强尼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong, Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.73,0:10:39.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在担心你爸爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worried about your father?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.67,0:10:43.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.30,0:10:46.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连瞎子也看得出来他病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even a blind man could see he's sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.74,0:10:51.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,癌症的特点就是长期的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thing about cancer is the time it takes...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.81,0:10:53.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对亲人的折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}...the toll on the loved ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.85,0:10:56.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生活为之改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lives that are altered.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.25,0:11:01.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,计划不得不变更\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plans that have to be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.89,0:11:05.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,强尼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.69,0:11:08.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我能帮你爸爸…\N{\fnArial\fs30}...what if I could help your dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.36,0:11:12.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗？怎么帮？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.23,0:11:14.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么帮不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is not important.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.20,0:11:18.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重要的是，如果我能治好他\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I could make him better?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.34,0:11:21.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他恢复健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give him back his health?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.58,0:11:25.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你愿意跟我谈个交易吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you be willing to make a deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.08,0:11:30.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开个价吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Name your price.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.05,0:11:35.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.93,0:11:41.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}...your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.77,0:11:48.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.94,0:11:54.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天一早，你父亲就会健康的像匹马\N{\fnArial\fs30}By sunrise tomorrow, your father will be healthy as a horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.71,0:11:59.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而摆在你面前的将会是一个完整的人生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you will have your whole life ahead of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.11,0:12:02.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这需要你来抉择，强尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your choice, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.68,0:12:06.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你只要，签个名\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you have to do is sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.45,0:12:34.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦，这样就可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that'll do just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.99,0:12:44.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.93,0:12:49.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早安，睡美人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning, sleeping beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.70,0:12:51.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.30,0:12:55.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你看起来… - 气色很好，对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You look... - Great, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.67,0:12:58.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今早医生帮我检查时也是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Least that's what the doc said when he looked at my x-rays this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.07,0:13:02.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你在说什么？ - 我最近病了，孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you talking about? - I've been sick, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.54,0:13:04.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但在我鼓起勇气告诉你之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I finally get up the nerve to tell you about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.15,0:13:06.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就已经康复了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...l'm not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.35,0:13:10.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也无法解释，不过我觉得自己健康的像匹马\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't explain it. But I feel healthy as a horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.09,0:13:14.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧，臭小子，我还得表演呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, come on, hotshot. I got a show to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.06,0:13:27.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一周以来就属这场观众最多 你知道我在想什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biggest crowd of the week. Hey, you know what I was thinking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.94,0:13:31.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个新特技，把我们推向巅峰\N{\fnArial\fs30}A new stunt. Put us over the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.41,0:13:34.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伟大的一跃，你我各在一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be a jump: Me on one side, you on the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.44,0:13:39.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用直升机来代替汽车或者火圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead of the cars or the ring of fire, a helicopter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.81,0:13:42.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对，那样肯定酷毙了，你认为呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That'd be pretty cool, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.45,0:13:47.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨，你只剩2分钟了 快穿上你的行头，儿子，否则…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you got two minutes to get in your suit, son, or you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.96,0:13:54.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗珊的父亲要把她送走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roxanne's dad is sending her away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.53,0:13:56.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们现在不走，就来不及了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't leave now, it will be too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.13,0:14:01.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好，真是伟大啊 两个一无所有的小毛孩搞私奔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's great, boy. That's great. Two kids on the run with nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.37,0:14:05.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你的目的是两人最后在一起 最好别搞这一套\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your goal is to end up together, that'll make sure it doesn't happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.51,0:14:08.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我宁愿铤而走险，也比在愚蠢的狂欢节上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather take my chances with her than to waste my whole life...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.31,0:14:10.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,表演飞车特技，浪费我的人生强\N{\fnArial\fs30}...jumping bikes at some stupid carnival.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.65,0:14:15.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸，这样的日子我受够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, I want something better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.35,0:14:23.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她老爸会在你们到达郡界之前 就叫警察把你们逮捕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her old man will have the cops on you before you get to county line.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.99,0:14:25.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么我最好马上出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I'd better get going then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.20,0:14:39.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿，臭小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hotshot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.65,0:14:48.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你骑葛瑞丝吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.35,0:14:57.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少它会让你有个好的开端\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least you'll have a good head start.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.97,0:15:12.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女士们，先生们，爆火巴顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, Barton Blaze!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.80,0:15:45.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女士们，先生们，请向出口处移动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, head for the exits.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.04,0:15:47.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请保持冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.01,0:15:52.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸？爸，没事的，我在这儿 我在这儿，没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad? Dad, it's all right, I'm here. I'm here, it's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.31,0:15:53.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.15,0:15:59.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸？爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad? Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.91,0:16:58.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你死了对我就没用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're no good to me dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.19,0:17:14.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你...你杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You... You killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.13,0:17:17.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经治好了他的癌症\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cured his cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.97,0:17:20.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的承诺仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.74,0:17:24.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不能让他妨碍到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I couldn't let him come between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.14,0:17:26.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.24,0:17:31.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总有一天，当我需要你的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day, when I need you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.28,0:17:34.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会再来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}...I will come.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.55,0:17:38.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但在那之前，我会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until then, I'll be...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.42,0:17:41.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会看着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.92,0:17:45.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,忘记你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget about friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.56,0:17:48.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,忘记你的家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget about family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.50,0:17:52.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,忘记你的爱情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget about love.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.17,0:18:00.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是我的，爆火强尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're mine, Johnny Blaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.22,0:18:52.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能活在恐惧中\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't live in fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.19,0:18:55.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能活在恐惧中\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't live in fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.57,0:19:03.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,强尼！强尼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny, Johnny! Johnny, Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.94,0:19:05.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,强尼！强尼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny, Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.43,0:19:29.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爆火强尼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny Blaze!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.86,0:19:31.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好样的！强尼！好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Johnny! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.49,0:20:26.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女士们，先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.72,0:20:29.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请留在原地，让急救人员通过\N{\fnArial\fs30}...please stay off the field to allow paramedics through.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.39,0:20:32.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢，天啊！噢，天啊！JB！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. Oh, God. JB!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.80,0:20:42.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,JB，跟我说说话！\N{\fnArial\fs30}JB, talk to me, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.74,0:20:50.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼，车子没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heck, is the bike okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.51,0:20:55.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的！是的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.35,0:20:58.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,车子没事，噢，天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bike's fine. Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.95,0:21:02.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.36,0:21:04.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回家吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.86,0:21:08.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我听听你们的掌声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hear it for him, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.70,0:21:12.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可思议的，爆火强尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The amazing Johnny Blaze!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.97,0:21:17.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,强尼，你把我们吓了一大跳 当时发生了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny, you gave us all a big scare. What happened out there tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.67,0:21:20.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿，JB不接受采访的，好吗？ 对不起，借过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, JB don't do interviews, all right? I'm sorry. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.53,0:21:27.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（欢迎来到德州）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.38,0:21:33.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（爆火车队）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.66,0:21:40.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来啊，上啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.23,0:21:44.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前轮着地啊！噢！可恶！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the front end down. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.50,0:21:45.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爆火出局了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blaze is down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.87,0:21:48.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你这么喜欢撞车啊？ - 那你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have you tried not crashing? - Have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.70,0:21:53.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就不能跟他们一样喝瓶啤酒休息一下吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you have a beer and relax like everybody else, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.97,0:21:56.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道酒精只会让我做恶梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know alcohol gives me nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.11,0:22:01.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人各有所好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}To each his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.51,0:22:07.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.69,0:22:09.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下，转回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wait, could you go back?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.12,0:22:13.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,探索频道今晚有个关于吼猴的特辑\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a howler monkey special on Discovery Channel tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.83,0:22:16.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 伙计们，看！ - 极限运动场中会出现各种事故\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Guys, hey. - We've seen big moves and crashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.83,0:22:19.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当问到那些车手，他们最崇拜的人时\N{\fnArial\fs30}But ask these riders who it is they look up to...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.47,0:22:23.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一致的答案却是从未出场比赛过的人 “爆火强尼”\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and the answer's a man who's not even competing here, Johnny Blaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.44,0:22:25.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊，因为他正坐在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's because he's right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.94,0:22:27.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,史上最棒的特技车手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greatest stunt rider of all time...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.77,0:22:31.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,…但我们不知道的是 爆火强尼还能死里逃生多少次\N{\fnArial\fs30}...but what we don't know is how much longer can Blaze cheat death.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.24,0:22:34.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 评论家称之为付费观赏的飞车自杀秀 - 看那个猴子节目吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Critics call it pay-per-view suicide... - Put the monkey show on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.25,0:22:36.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦克，看猴子节目？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mack, the monkey show?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.55,0:22:38.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,…似乎根本不关心自己的死活\N{\fnArial\fs30}With no regard for his own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.49,0:22:41.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都叫他无敌先生 而在他的下一次跳越中\N{\fnArial\fs30}They call him Mr. Invincible, and he'll have to be at his next jump...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.02,0:22:43.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爆火强尼将试图飞跃\N{\fnArial\fs30}...when Johnny Blaze will attempt to clear...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.19,0:22:47.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从球门到球门，一整个足球场的距离\N{\fnArial\fs30}...the length of a football field from field goal to field goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.17,0:22:56.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.04,0:23:02.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？在像今天的那种情况下 你早就该死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"What." You should be taking a dirt nap after that ragdoll today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.64,0:23:04.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是幸运而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.01,0:23:09.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的，我有只猎犬的名字也叫“幸运” 他只有一只眼睛，而且连蛋蛋都没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I got a hunting dog named Lucky. He's got one eye and no nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.35,0:23:13.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光靠运气是不够的，强尼 一定是有个天使在守护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luck don't cover it, JB. Man, you got an angel looking after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.02,0:23:16.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 也许吧 - 麦克，你玩不玩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, maybe. - Mack, you in?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.36,0:23:19.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.19,0:23:23.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让开点，女士们，怎么玩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scoot over, ladies. What's the ante?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.23,0:23:24.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玩梭哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five card draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.66,0:23:26.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许是别的什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.35,0:24:14.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.28,0:24:17.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可真够慢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took you long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.11,0:24:44.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小子，我想你迷路了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you might be lost, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.44,0:24:46.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你聋了还是怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You deaf or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.18,0:24:48.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里只准天使进入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angels only in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.02,0:24:51.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使？真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angels. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.99,0:24:55.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错，你不爽吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, really. You got a problem with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.89,0:24:59.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a matter of fact...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.61,0:25:17.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是不爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}...I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.82,0:25:30.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱死你住的地方了，强尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. Love your neighborhood, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.12,0:25:33.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一派和谐友善的景象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real friendly around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.07,0:25:42.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来你还是没给你家的电梯上锁 很好，很好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I see you still haven't gotten a lock for your lift. That's great, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.90,0:25:46.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你有很多贵重的摩托车在这里 我跟你说过多少次了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got a lot of expensive bikes in here, I told you. How many times?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.21,0:25:50.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,JB，我以前就说过，现在再说一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, JB, I said it before, I'll say it again:
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.04,0:25:52.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这里需要有个女人在，阴阳调和一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place could use a womars touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.08,0:25:56.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你也一样 - 那倒是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So could you. - Heard that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.95,0:26:02.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好，五分之四 再摔一辆就收集全套了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, four out of five. Wreck one more and you get the whole set.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.26,0:26:09.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来你总算找到书的用途了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm glad to see you found use for your books.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.96,0:26:11.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要吃软糖吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want some jellies?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.43,0:26:14.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不，我才不要你的烂糖果\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I don't want none of your stupid candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.24,0:26:21.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实，我想跟你谈一件很重要的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna talk to you about something kind of serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.77,0:26:22.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦克，我正在想办法放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to relax, Mack.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.14,0:26:26.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是，我明白… 一会儿就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I understand. All right? It's just gonna take a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.95,0:26:35.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于你爸逝世周年的飞车表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about you jumping on the anniversary of your dad's accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.39,0:26:41.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我，我可以把音乐停一下吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I just turn this music off for a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.96,0:26:44.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要你踢的高一些，能吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to kick higher for me. Can you get higher?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.63,0:26:46.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个飞越，伙计，我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This jump, man, we...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.63,0:26:48.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上啊，打它！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Hit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.07,0:26:52.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦克 如果你再敢碰那卡朋特的歌或那猩猩节目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mack, you touch the Carpenters or that chimp video again...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.51,0:26:56.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 就等着吃我的拳头吧 - 这次的飞越太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and we got a scrap on our hands. - This jump is nuts. All right, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.78,0:26:59.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说，飞越整个球场 现在你又要在中间加车子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, field goal to field goal, and now you're adding cars?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.65,0:27:02.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说，你到底想要证明什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what are you trying to prove?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.95,0:27:05.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,证明确实是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.69,0:27:06.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That it's you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.42,0:27:08.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在骑车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riding the bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.39,0:27:12.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然是你，还会有谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course it's you, man. Who the hell else is it gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.29,0:27:14.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗？你现在真的把我搞毛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, you're freaking me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.36,0:27:16.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你没事在看这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're freaking me out because you're reading...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.66,0:27:19.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邪里邪气的怪书\N{\fnArial\fs30}...this comparative exponential religiosity crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.83,0:27:21.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你脑子中邪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's getting in your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.50,0:27:25.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了，到底发生什么事了，伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what's going on, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.61,0:27:29.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你相信人会有第二次机会吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you believe people get second chances?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.61,0:27:30.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我，我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}L... I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.01,0:27:34.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果有人犯了错，一个很严重的错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}If somebody makes a mistake, a big mistake...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.18,0:27:37.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为那个人这辈子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}...do you think that person should have to pay for it...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.82,0:27:39.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就该每天为此赎罪吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}...every day for the rest of their lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.52,0:27:42.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是在说你爸的意外吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you talking about your daddy's accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.79,0:27:45.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.23,0:27:49.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是在寻找一种征兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just looking for a sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.83,0:27:52.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么样的征兆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of sign?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.17,0:27:56.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,证明我可以挽回过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I can take a negative and turn it into a positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.17,0:27:59.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也可以有第二次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I can have a second chance too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.94,0:28:05.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,JB，之前你父亲发生意外不是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}JB, what happened way back when to your daddy was not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.28,0:28:08.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道的，对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.72,0:28:16.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着，至少答应我你会考虑把车撤掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, at least promise me you'll think about taking the cars out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.26,0:28:19.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会考虑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.94,0:29:13.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你在这里，我可以嗅到你的恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you were here. I could smell your fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.06,0:29:30.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好，格雷希尔(地魔)！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Gressil.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.97,0:29:34.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来这干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.34,0:29:42.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瓦洛(水魔)！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wallow.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.48,0:29:49.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为何召唤我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what do you want from us?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.32,0:29:51.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是来找圣凡冈萨的契约的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've come for the contract of San Venganza.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.35,0:29:55.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,传说中，那份契约被偷后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Legend has it that the contract was stolen and hidden...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.06,0:29:57.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被藏在附近的墓地里\N{\fnArial\fs30}...in a graveyard not far from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.16,0:29:59.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们可以帮我找到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you're gonna help me find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.10,0:30:06.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿比戈尔（风魔）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abigor.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.80,0:30:09.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到之后要怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when we find it, then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.24,0:30:10.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后我们就能主宰这世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we'll take this world...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.74,0:30:13.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}...one city...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.34,0:30:16.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个城市的慢慢来\N{\fnArial\fs30}...at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.84,0:30:18.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑心魔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blackheart!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.53,0:30:41.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你在这干什么？ - 我的时代来临了，老家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell are you doing here? - It's my time now, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.27,0:30:46.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的时代会来临的，却不是现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your time will come. But not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.87,0:30:48.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你我都清楚，在这你伤害不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both know you can't harm me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.04,0:30:54.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不像你，我决不会失败 以后也不会失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not like you. I've never fallen. I never will.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.35,0:31:00.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这个世界，我的力量不如你 不过我的骑士却力量雄厚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may not have power over you in this world, but my rider does.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.99,0:31:03.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灵魂骑士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Ghost Rider?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.46,0:31:07.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最喜爱的作品？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your favorite creation?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.26,0:31:12.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把地狱之火的力量 浪费在一个可怜的人类身上？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The power of hellfire wasted on a pathetic human?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.57,0:31:14.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你信任我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you had trusted me...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.17,0:31:17.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你给予我应得的的力量…\N{\fnArial\fs30}...if you had given me what was rightfully mine...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.47,0:31:21.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在世界末日到来之前，一切都属于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all mine. Until the end of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.24,0:31:25.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.68,0:31:28.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,派你的骑士来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send the rider.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.12,0:31:30.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会亲手把他埋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bury him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.15,0:31:33.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后再把你埋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I'll bury you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.92,0:31:35.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.24,0:31:53.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女士们，先生们 欢迎来到爆火强尼的飞越死神秀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, welcome to the Johnny Blaze Leap of Death!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.84,0:31:54.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（飞越球场）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.68,0:31:59.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耶！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.22,0:32:06.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爆火强尼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny B!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.76,0:32:16.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂！JB！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, JB.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.03,0:32:18.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘘！你打断凯伦的歌声了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're stepping on Karen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.10,0:32:26.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚刚想说什么，麦克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was it you were gonna say, Mack?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.91,0:32:29.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我重新检查了一下起跳板，看起来还可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just ran a second check on the ramps. They look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.71,0:32:33.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,观众有点失控\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowd's kind of out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.88,0:32:37.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,强尼，你知道你并不需要这么做吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny, you know you don't have to do this, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.49,0:32:43.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这衣服合身吗？感觉有点大！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does this suit fit all right? Feels a little loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.49,0:32:45.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很合身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suit's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.03,0:32:49.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮我拿一下头盔好吗，麦克？ 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you bring me my hat, Mack? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.30,0:32:58.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能活在恐惧中\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't live in fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.11,0:33:02.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好，一直靠右走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we're up here on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.08,0:33:04.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爆火先生 我是活动新闻部的安妮.珮吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Blaze. Amy Page, event publicity.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.14,0:33:07.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 有时间做个简短的访问吗 - 我不知道你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have time for a quick interview? - I don't know how long...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.91,0:33:10.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你进这行有多久了 爆火强尼是从来不接受访问的\N{\fnArial\fs30}...you been doing your job, but Johnny Blaze don't do interviews.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.98,0:33:12.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就连老朋友也不行吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even for an old friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.40,0:33:25.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好，强尼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.94,0:33:31.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.34,0:33:34.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我接受采访\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.37,0:33:36.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,补妆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makeup.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.28,0:33:41.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.62,0:33:45.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢，你在打量这身行头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're looking at the suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.99,0:33:50.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道它看上去很蠢，但粉丝们喜欢 所以我得穿着它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's silly, but the fans like it, so I keep on wearing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.12,0:33:54.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 那拐杖怎么解释 - 靠它来支撑身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about the cane? - I need support.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.79,0:33:57.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不，这是服装的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It's part of the costume.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.93,0:34:03.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好，准备，五，四，三，二…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, and ready in five, four, three, two...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.47,0:34:04.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爸还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's your dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.04,0:34:09.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爆火强尼！谢谢你愿意在 这么重要的演出之前接受我们的采访\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny Blaze, thank you for talking to us before your big jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.61,0:34:12.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从来没有人尝试过这么远距离的飞越\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one has ever attempted such a distance before:
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.81,0:34:15.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞越三百英尺长的足球场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three hundred feet from field goal to field goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.88,0:34:18.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在的心里在想什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going through your mind right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.32,0:34:21.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你美呆了，我在电视上看到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look really good. I've seen you on TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.85,0:34:25.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道，我常看电视，你的表现很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I watch a lot of TV and you do a really good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.23,0:34:31.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,强尼 是什么让你愿意冒险娱乐大众呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny, what drives somebody to risk their life for entertainment?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.46,0:34:32.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说你结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard you got married.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.40,0:34:37.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有，我没结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. No, it didn't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.20,0:34:39.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有…噢…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.57,0:34:44.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大多媒体都会关注你所付出的代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of the time the press focuses on the crashes, the broken bones...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.18,0:34:46.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,例如撞车，骨折！\N{\fnArial\fs30}...the costs of what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.08,0:34:48.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除此以外还有其他代价吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are there any other costs?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.22,0:34:59.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. 
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.63,0:35:03.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧！那…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.20,0:35:07.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你让我们分享爆火强尼的内心世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for this revealing peek into the life of Johnny Blaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.90,0:35:10.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗姗·辛普森，现场报道！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Roxanne Simpson, on scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.94,0:35:12.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好，完成！\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.17,0:35:16.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你会留下来看表演吗？ - 哦，我们得赶回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're gonna stay for the jump, right? - You know, we gotta get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.81,0:35:19.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更何况，我从来不喜欢看你表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus, I never liked watching you jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.68,0:35:27.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 求你了 - 该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please. - Let's go, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.25,0:35:28.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗姗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roxanne?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.49,0:35:39.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 拜托，就签一下 - 你得回到你的座位上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, just one signature. - You need to get back to your seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.43,0:35:43.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 别推啊 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't have to push. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.54,0:35:46.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我敢说你们两个过去肯定有段情史\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go out on a limb and say you two had some kind of history.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.34,0:35:48.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是她，麦克！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was it, Mack.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.51,0:35:50.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个征兆！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.14,0:35:52.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,征兆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sign?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.68,0:35:57.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你确定不留下来一会儿？ - 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sure you don't wanna stick around? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.48,0:35:59.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,表演还没开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}It hasn't started yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.59,0:36:01.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不我请你吃甜甜圈吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll buy you a doughnut.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.82,0:36:03.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托，罗珊 那可是爆火强尼啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Roxie, it's Johnny Blaze.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.56,0:36:05.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.09,0:36:08.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢天谢地，你总算听我劝 把车子撤掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God you listened to me, took the cars out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.39,0:36:10.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然这简直就是自杀行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would've been suicide otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.70,0:36:12.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在这样，万一你跳不过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way if you come up short, see...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.17,0:36:16.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以掉到一片，松软的，绿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}...you'll come down on some nice, soft, green...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.41,0:36:20.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,草上\N{\fnArial\fs30}...grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.71,0:36:24.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爆火强尼将不会如预期的那样 跳越50辆车子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny Blaze will not be jumping 50 cars today as scheduled...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.71,0:36:29.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,取而代之的是跳跃 6台UH-60黑鹰直升机\N{\fnArial\fs30}...but instead will be leaping six UH-60 Black Hawk helicopters.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.45,0:36:33.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从来没人尝试过如此大胆的表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never before has any man attempted such a death-defying stunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.45,0:36:36.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把车撤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took the cars out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.06,0:36:43.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么？为什么，JB？ 为什么不先跟我商量？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Why, JB? Why wouldn't you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.10,0:36:46.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 因为你肯定会生气的 - 你可以叫我老古董\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Because you would have thrown a fit. - Call me old-fashioned...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.07,0:36:50.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这方面是挺可笑 但这种拿人当祭品的行为让我很不舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}...l'm funny that way. Human sacrifice makes me uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.37,0:36:53.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么，JB？ 为什么一定要是直升机？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, JB? Why helicopters, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.71,0:36:57.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我在想什么吗？ 一个新的特技\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I've been thinking about? A new stunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.81,0:37:00.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但不是用车子或火圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}But instead of the cars or the ring of fire...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.65,0:37:03.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是用直升机\N{\fnArial\fs30}...a helicopter.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.55,0:37:07.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸认为这样会很酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad thought it'd be cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.79,0:37:13.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 他说对了 - 是啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He was right. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.96,0:37:15.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好，好，那我们这样安排吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay. This is the deal, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.93,0:37:18.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要你到起跳板中段时 按下氮气加速系统，知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Halfway down the ramp I want you to hit the NOS, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.86,0:37:20.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别太早按了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not hit the NOS too early.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.33,0:37:22.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你太早加速 你就完蛋了，知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you hit it too early, you are screwed. You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.50,0:37:25.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,JB，你到底有没有在听啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, JB, where's your head at, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.97,0:37:30.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她大概在高速公路上了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's probably on the interstate by now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.32,0:37:39.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你加了多少氮气？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much NOS did you put in the tanks?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.29,0:37:42.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,足够让航天飞机蒙羞了 说吧，凯斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough to shame the space shuttle. Chief, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.86,0:37:53.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢，天啊，他做不到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. He ain't gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.19,0:38:14.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.62,0:38:20.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就说他做的到嘛 好啊，JB！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you he'd make it! Yeah, JB!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.33,0:38:22.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为之鼓掌吧，女士们，先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hear it for him, ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.43,0:38:25.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三百英尺，是一个只有爆火强尼 才能达到的世界纪录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three hundred feet! A world record, as only Johnny Blaze can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.91,0:38:39.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耶！耶！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.45,0:38:47.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他要去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's he going?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.75,0:38:50.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于那家伙，其他的不说 可他的胆子可真大！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll say one thing about the guy, he's got guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.82,0:38:53.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说，之前我有一天正好在看个体育节目\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the other day I was watching this, like, sports show...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.96,0:38:56.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯图尔特 可不可以不要再讨论爆火强尼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stuart, can you please stop talking about Johnny Blaze already?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.47,0:39:02.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这… 恐怕有点困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that might be a little hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.24,0:39:07.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.34,0:39:12.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 停一下车吧 - 要我停车吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pull over! - Do you want me to pull over?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.81,0:39:14.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 继续开 - 好，继续开…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Drive. - Driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.82,0:39:25.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托，罗珊，我有话跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Roxie, I need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.73,0:39:36.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什么名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.40,0:39:39.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么？ - 你叫什么名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.61,0:39:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦，斯图尔特！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Stuart!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.01,0:39:43.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 强尼 - 啊，你好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Johnny. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.78,0:39:45.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯图尔特，你可以帮个忙吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Stuart, can you help me out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.01,0:39:49.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起，伙计… 这里她做主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, dude. She's the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.52,0:39:53.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,强尼，小心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny, look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.46,0:40:06.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧，我知道我该怎么办了 等着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I guess I see how it's gonna be. Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.55,0:40:27.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好！你好！你好！你好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howdy. Howdy, howdy, howdy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.09,0:40:30.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想自杀吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you trying to kill yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.26,0:40:33.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想跟你谈谈 我们已经有五万六千年没见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna talk to you. I haven't seen you in 56,000 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.79,0:40:35.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这太疯狂了，你是个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is crazy. You are crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.59,0:40:37.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗，强尼？我没时间管这事 我还有稿子要编\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have time for this, I have a story to edit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.10,0:40:39.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以拒绝的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have said no.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.83,0:40:44.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们提出要你采访我的时候 你大可以拒绝的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they asked you to interview me, you could have said no.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.70,0:40:48.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 把你的车子移开 - 你想说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Move your van out of the way! - What are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.07,0:40:52.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是想说什么 我是说，这一定有它的含义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm not trying to say anything. I'm saying that means something.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.68,0:40:56.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 抱歉！ - 别管他们，没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry! - Don't mind them, they're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.52,0:40:58.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在可是停在高速公路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are on the side of the freeway.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.75,0:41:02.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一起吃晚饭吧 你还是喜欢吃…意大利菜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get some dinner. You still like Italian?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.26,0:41:07.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底想怎么样，强尼？ 想做个了结吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this about, Johnny? You want some closure?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.99,0:41:11.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着，你那时候才十七岁 你遭遇了一场悲剧，所以逃走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you were 17 and you witnessed a tragedy and you ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.93,0:41:13.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白，我当时就明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand now like I understood then...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.10,0:41:15.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没对你抱任何恨意，一点也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and I have no hard feelings, none.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.17,0:41:20.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么叫过去，就是已经过去了 完成了，结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why they call it the past, because it's passed. It's done, it's over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.35,0:41:28.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太过火了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.65,0:41:37.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我住的酒店里有家餐厅 广场餐厅，八点整\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a restaurant in my hotel, the Plaza. Eight o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.42,0:41:38.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好耶！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.13,0:41:43.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不准迟到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.56,0:41:45.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是个征兆，罗姗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a sign, Roxanne.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.76,0:41:47.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会有意外的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no accidents.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.90,0:41:49.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destiny and all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.64,0:41:51.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,强尼，强尼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny! Johnny! Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.94,0:41:54.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 可以帮我妹妹签个名吗？ - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you please sign my sister's book? - Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.51,0:41:55.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 三百英尺 - 我们爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 300 feet. - We love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.71,0:41:57.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯，谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.31,0:41:59.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是三百英尺，太酷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three hundred feet. Pretty neat, pretty neat.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.65,0:42:00.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好极了，强尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right on, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.39,0:42:08.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.51,0:42:11.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（0条信息）
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.11,0:42:33.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能活在恐惧中\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't live in fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.98,0:42:36.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能活在恐惧中\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't live in fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.32,0:42:39.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你成功了，别人都做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made that jump. No one else made that jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.95,0:42:41.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是最优秀的车手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the best rider.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.96,0:42:47.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该得到第二次机会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You deserve a second chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.99,0:42:49.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她绝对是个预兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.51,0:43:10.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,强尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.61,0:43:39.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.64,0:44:14.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,强尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.85,0:44:56.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.29,0:44:59.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好啊，强尼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.73,0:45:02.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离我远一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.16,0:45:04.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在说这些是不是太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little late for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.43,0:45:07.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很漂亮的车子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.34,0:45:11.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.10,0:45:15.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直都在这里啊，强尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I've always been here, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.14,0:45:17.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直都在\N{\fnArial\fs30}All along.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.78,0:45:19.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凤凰城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phoenix...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.44,0:45:20.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丹佛\N{\fnArial\fs30}...Denver...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.81,0:45:22.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,休士顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}...Houston.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.78,0:45:25.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然是你，每次都不让我死\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was you. Keeping me alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.82,0:45:27.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不，不，强尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.05,0:45:29.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那全都靠你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.39,0:45:32.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是最棒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.59,0:45:35.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我，是你最狂热的车迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm your greatest fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.06,0:45:39.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,海报，电玩游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}The posters, the video games...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.63,0:45:44.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们都在激动的喊叫着\N{\fnArial\fs30}...the crowds screaming, chanting:
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.37,0:45:45.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,强尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.74,0:45:48.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,强尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.51,0:45:51.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,强尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny."
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.91,0:45:54.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这让我多么骄傲啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes me so proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.75,0:46:00.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像是看着自己的投资\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like watching an investment...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.32,0:46:03.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一天一天的升值\N{\fnArial\fs30}...that keeps growing and growing...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.59,0:46:07.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到要兑现的那一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}...until the day you cash it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.76,0:46:11.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是今天了，强尼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That day is today, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.96,0:46:15.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去找一个叫黑心魔的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find the one known as Blackheart...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.47,0:46:17.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and destroy him.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.70,0:46:19.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己去找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find him yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.74,0:46:22.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样可不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesrt work like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.84,0:46:25.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟我签了约的，忘了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're under contract, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.51,0:46:29.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you succeed...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.18,0:46:32.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就把灵魂还给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}...l'll return your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.62,0:46:35.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm not doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.79,0:46:37.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have any choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.90,0:47:52.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.17,0:47:55.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不能进来这里 这地方属于私人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't come in here. This is private...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.44,0:48:00.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,产业\N{\fnArial\fs30}...property.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.71,0:48:02.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里曾经是块墓地？\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a cemetery here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.61,0:48:05.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦，是的！很久以前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.48,0:48:08.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些坟墓怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to the graves?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.38,0:48:11.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被移走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They moved them.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.55,0:48:13.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,移去哪去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.82,0:48:19.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我不知道 - 谁会知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know. - Who would?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.79,0:48:24.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯…圣米迦勒教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saint Michael's church.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.60,0:48:26.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们负责处理这件事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're in charge of the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.67,0:48:29.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着，你们真的不该进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you really shouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.37,0:48:34.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这话我听多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what they keep telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.76,0:48:55.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}God!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.29,0:50:01.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在找人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.33,0:50:04.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚回地狱去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.10,0:50:09.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来我们没有必要再谈什么了，是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna have a meaningful conversation now, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.80,0:50:11.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.37,0:50:14.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.91,0:50:51.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（我车开的如何）
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.62,0:51:04.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他也不怎么样嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ain't so tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.36,0:51:14.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂！臭家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Dirtbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.51,0:51:28.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发发慈悲吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.88,0:51:32.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉，对你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. All out of mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.20,0:51:48.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.53,0:52:52.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.20,0:52:55.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我漂亮吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm pretty, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.27,0:53:02.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他妈的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.21,0:53:08.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把包给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the damn bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.65,0:53:09.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.02,0:53:13.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.06,0:53:26.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.40,0:53:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.07,0:53:33.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有罪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.44,0:53:41.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着我的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look into my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.32,0:53:51.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的灵魂被无辜者的鲜血所污染\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your soul is stained by the blood of the innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.83,0:53:55.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感受一下他们的痛苦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel their pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.86,0:54:00.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.87,0:54:07.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把钱包给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me your wallet!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.18,0:54:13.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.71,0:55:44.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（挚爱的父亲爆火巴顿）
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.44,0:55:52.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早啊，骷髅头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning, bonehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.44,0:56:44.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（卡特史雷，愿天使引领）
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.68,0:57:06.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你好点了吗？ - 是的，好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You all right? - Yeah, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.32,0:57:09.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得好像全身着了火 谢谢你的水\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like my skull's on fire, but I'm good. Thanks for the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.45,0:57:10.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看到我的摩托车了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see my bike?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.49,0:57:13.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说的话好笑吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I say something funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.19,0:57:15.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是讽刺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ironic.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.69,0:57:18.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们这里都爱讽刺人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're big on irony around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.40,0:57:22.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 摩托车在那间屋子里 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's out by the shed. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.40,0:57:23.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它很正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.10,0:57:26.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.27,0:57:29.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怀疑你的摩托车是不是正常？ 很正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wondering if your bike looks normal? It does.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.68,0:57:32.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有，回答你另一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to answer your other questions:
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.48,0:57:34.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚的事是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last night did happen...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.51,0:57:36.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}...it wasrt a dream...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.75,0:57:38.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且它会再次发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and it will happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.72,0:57:41.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.19,0:57:45.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题是…，你又是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Question is, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.92,0:57:50.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是传说中的骑士，灵魂骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the Rider. The Ghost Rider.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.56,0:57:54.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点习惯吧，那样会好过一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get used to it, kid. It'll be a lot easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.63,0:57:57.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然，我有块墓地刚好适合你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't, I got a nice cozy spot picked out for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.33,0:58:14.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们已经看到你了 他们会等着你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've seen you now. They'll be waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.66,0:58:18.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想活命就需要我帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll need my help, you expect to last the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.03,0:58:22.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上次我让一个陌生人帮我，结果却不怎么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time I let a stranger help me it didn't pan out so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.70,0:58:25.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是你想逃就逃得了的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ain't something you can run from, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.77,0:58:28.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,签下契约就已经注定了会有今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}This day has been coming since you made that deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.95,0:58:39.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.02,0:58:42.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你成功的机会刚从零改为渺茫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your chances just went from none to slim.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.89,0:58:46.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根据可靠消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sources close to the investigation say that there may be a link...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.19,0:58:49.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次在市中心所发生的事件很可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}...between what happened here in downtown...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.43,0:58:51.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟之前在沙漠里发生的大屠杀事件有关联\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and the Broken Spoke massacre in the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.90,0:58:53.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗姗·辛普森，现场报导！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Roxanne Simpson on scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.60,0:58:55.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好，完成！\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.84,0:58:59.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 多兰警官 - 无可奉告\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Captain Dolan. - No comment.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.24,0:59:01.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之前发生的大屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true they found a connection between the massacre...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.14,0:59:04.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟昨晚的事件真的有关吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and last night's victim here at the city train yards?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.12,0:59:10.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无可奉告\N{\fnArial\fs30}No comment.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.89,0:59:14.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,私下谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Off the record, captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.73,0:59:19.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,私下谈谈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Off the record?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.69,0:59:20.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Piss off.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.13,0:59:28.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灵魂骑士是恶魔的赏金猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Rider is the devil's bounty hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.44,0:59:33.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,专门负责收集那些从地狱逃脱的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sent to hunt down anyone that escapes from hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.68,0:59:36.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮我消毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sterilize that for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.34,0:59:38.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sterilize.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.52,0:59:46.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用开水\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the boiling water.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.02,0:59:48.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.86,0:59:51.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有点困惑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.66,0:59:54.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在白天你会是正常人\N{\fnArial\fs30}During the day you'll be normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.70,0:59:57.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但一到夜晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}But at night...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.63,1:00:00.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当你面对邪恶时\N{\fnArial\fs30}...in the presence of evil...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.34,1:00:03.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就会变成骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}...the Rider takes over.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.37,1:00:06.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember now.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.61,1:00:07.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last night.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.31,1:00:14.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是个小混混…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was some punk...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.98,1:00:18.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以看到他所犯的一切罪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and I could see all the wrong he'd ever done...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.89,1:00:21.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并且把这些罪加注在他身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and I turned it all against him.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.86,1:00:23.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,忏悔之眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Penance Stare.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.23,1:00:27.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那能灼烧罪恶之魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sears the souls of the wicked.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.90,1:00:31.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是灵魂骑士最厉害的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the Ghost Rider's greatest weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.90,1:00:33.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有的骑士都有这种能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the Riders have it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.74,1:00:40.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有其他人 跟我遇到了相同的麻烦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have there been others with my "Ghost Rider" problem?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.24,1:00:42.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有几个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been a few.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.91,1:00:45.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上一个已经是150年前的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last one was 150 years ago...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.58,1:00:49.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在一个名为圣凡冈萨的小镇上\N{\fnArial\fs30}...in a little town called San Venganza.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.75,1:00:52.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好的小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice town.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.19,1:00:54.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很友好的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice people.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.92,1:00:58.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到有个陌生人跑来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till a stranger came along making promises...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.76,1:01:00.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和村民订下契约\N{\fnArial\fs30}...one deal at a time.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.40,1:01:05.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被贪婪所驱使的人们开始互相残杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consumed by greed, they turned on one another...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.63,1:01:10.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到圣凡冈萨被淹没在自己的鲜血中\N{\fnArial\fs30}...until the village of San Venganza drowned in its own blood...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.67,1:01:15.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而那些灵魂 被永久的困在那个被上帝遗忘的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}...their souls trapped forever in that godforsaken place.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.81,1:01:17.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这跟黑心魔有什么关系？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this have to do with Blackheart?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.15,1:01:21.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑心魔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blackheart?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.68,1:01:25.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他要你对付黑心魔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sent you after Blackheart?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.45,1:01:27.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有其他几个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And others.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.19,1:01:29.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放逐之魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Hidden.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.09,1:01:36.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都是被圣米迦勒逐出天堂的堕落天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fallen angels cast out of heaven by Saint Michael himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.10,1:01:42.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们藏身自然元素之中，等待着世界末日的到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They hide within the elements waiting for the end of days.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.61,1:01:47.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最好待在这里，孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better hang around here, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.11,1:01:52.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们无法进入这块圣地\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't come onto hallowed ground.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.68,1:01:55.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.32,1:01:57.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有，谢谢你提供的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}And thanks for the info.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.79,1:02:00.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道我是恶魔的赏金猎人 感觉好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel much better now that I know I'm the devil's bounty hunter.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.63,1:02:07.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你要去哪里？ - 有个人我一定得见一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where you going? - Somebody I gotta see.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.83,1:02:09.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是个坏决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.37,1:02:13.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正也不是第一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldrt be my first.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.34,1:02:18.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么那么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.88,1:02:23.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么签下那份契约？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you make the deal?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.38,1:02:25.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当时只是个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.51,1:02:28.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你得到了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you get in return?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.55,1:02:35.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heartache.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.03,1:02:48.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,队长，队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain. Captain!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.74,1:02:51.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骑车人和加油站经理身上的痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forensics on the bikers and the station manager...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.17,1:02:54.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,表明死因相同\N{\fnArial\fs30}...suggest the same cause of death.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.88,1:02:57.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,硫磺中毒？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sulfur poison?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.51,1:03:00.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我想硫磺是没有毒的 - 大剂量时就有毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't think sulfur was toxic. - It is, in massive doses.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.75,1:03:03.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人被淹没在硫磺里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And these guys were swimming in it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.25,1:03:05.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是有人用化学武器袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be the work of a chemical attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.42,1:03:07.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者是宗教狂热分子所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or a religious nut.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.49,1:03:10.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿，我认识你，我在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. I know you. I've seen...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.99,1:03:15.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里没什么能表明是宗教性质的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? There's nothing here to suggest any kind of religious m.o.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.10,1:03:18.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 硫磺？ - 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sulfur? - What about it?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.27,1:03:19.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,读过《旧约》吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever read the Old Testament?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.84,1:03:24.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,硫磺烈火 （用以惩罚有罪者的地狱之火）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brimstone.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.81,1:03:26.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.05,1:03:34.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦，天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.46,1:03:45.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很难形容今早这里遭到的破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hard to describe the destruction here this morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.79,1:03:48.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麻烦你们往后站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I get you people to stand back, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.23,1:03:51.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不清楚，看上去像是超自然力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. It seems like something supernatural.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.93,1:03:54.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以跟我们描述一下救你的人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you tell us about the Good Samaritan?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.33,1:03:56.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯，首先我是绝对不会忘记他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'll never forget him, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.17,1:04:01.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他个子高高的，肩膀很宽 皮包骨的那种瘦\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was tall, broad shoulders, and thin, really thin, like bony.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.81,1:04:05.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他骑着一辆很炫的车，全是火焰\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he had this rad chopper, it was all flames and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.78,1:04:10.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有，他的脸是个骷髅，还冒着火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and his face was a skull and it was on fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.66,1:04:16.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冒火？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"On fire."
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.52,1:04:17.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的，像是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, like:
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.43,1:04:21.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哗哗…那么大的火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like that much fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.20,1:04:25.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且，可能这听起来有点怪 不过那挺适合他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know it sounds weird, but it looked okay on him.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.67,1:04:29.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说，他的打扮很前卫，可是他超帅的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it was an edge look but he totally pulled it off.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.61,1:04:33.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听来很不可思议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not sure what to add to that.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.58,1:04:37.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗姗·辛普森，现场报导！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Roxanne Simpson on scene.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.95,1:04:39.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.79,1:04:49.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 罗珊… - 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Roxie... - Don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.22,1:04:52.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不，等一下，让我道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, hold on a second. Let me apologize.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.93,1:04:55.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 昨晚的事，我实在不敢求你原谅 - 你不需要道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Last night was inexcusable. - No apologies.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.10,1:04:58.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗？你昨晚帮了我一个大忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, you did me a favor last night...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.13,1:05:01.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为，你让我想起过去，现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}...because you made me think of then and now.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.80,1:05:04.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你走的那一天，是的 我哭得像快死了一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when you left, yeah, it hurt like hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.47,1:05:06.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你知道吗？我熬过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what? I got over it...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.14,1:05:10.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我上了大学 找到了一份好工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and I went to college, I got a great job.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.78,1:05:12.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你呢，强尼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you, Johnny...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.05,1:05:14.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是老样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}...you're just the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.52,1:05:18.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你现在收入高了，粉丝也多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, better paid, more fans...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.39,1:05:20.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你还是个耍杂技的\N{\fnArial\fs30}...but you're still just a carny.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.99,1:05:27.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.10,1:05:29.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.23,1:05:31.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来我爸说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad was right.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.10,1:05:33.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只是一段插曲罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were just a phase.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.74,1:05:42.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,口才不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That went well.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.35,1:05:49.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,队长，我有新发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, captain! I got something.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.60,1:06:35.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（浮世烩）
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.54,1:06:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世界末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}"End of days.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.02,1:06:58.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,寄主可以通过\N{\fnArial\fs30}The host can gain control of the possessing spirit...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.99,1:07:03.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对人体自身固有的火元素的专注与操控\N{\fnArial\fs30}...through concentration on and manipulation of...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.52,1:07:07.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,逐步控制其所占据的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}...the fire element that exists within man."
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.87,1:07:21.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在命令我内心的火焰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am speaking to the fire element within me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.68,1:07:26.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我控制自己灵魂的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me control over the possessing spirit.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.14,1:07:50.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 嗨！ - 嗨！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.50,1:07:53.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望你不介意，但你的电梯没上锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I hope you don't mind. Your lift was open.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.98,1:07:58.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是来道歉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.31,1:08:01.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我今晚就要离开这个城市了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm leaving town tonight...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.82,1:08:06.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不希望今天所说的话 是我们的告别词\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and I didn't want what I said today to be the last words between us.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.99,1:08:09.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 没关系 - 不，有关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's okay. - No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.16,1:08:14.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些话太残忍，而且完全不真实\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was cruel and totally untrue.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.90,1:08:16.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我觉得很过意不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I feel really terrible about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.76,1:08:19.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不，真的没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, don't. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.94,1:08:22.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有东西烧焦了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is something burning?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.34,1:08:28.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是我邻居的烧烤炉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that must be coming from outside. Neighbor's hibachi.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.51,1:08:29.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比尔，他刚买了一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill, he just got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.18,1:08:31.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还保留着那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still have that one.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.31,1:08:33.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You what?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.92,1:08:37.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个我也有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have that one, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.83,1:08:48.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记得那天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember that day.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.26,1:08:52.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有很多人排队…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were a dozen people waiting in line...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.37,1:08:54.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你却投了成堆的铜板\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and you went through a whole roll of quarters.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.30,1:08:58.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的表情，看得出我在害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at my face. You can tell I was just terrified...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.41,1:09:01.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怕我爸随时会进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}...that my dad was gonna come in any second.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.19,1:09:17.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了，我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I just...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.83,1:09:23.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…我还是送你回车上吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just... I think I should walk you to your car.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.50,1:09:28.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不是时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, it's not great timing.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.74,1:09:34.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首先，你为了约我出去 差点撞死在高速公路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You almost kill yourself on the highway...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.01,1:09:37.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你却没来赴约\N{\fnArial\fs30}...so you can ask me out and then you don't show.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.51,1:09:39.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后你一直保留着我的照片…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you keep my picture...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.38,1:09:42.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是当我吻你的时候，你又想推我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}...but when I kiss you, you try to shove me out the door. What's...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.72,1:09:44.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这到底是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.02,1:09:48.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你难道一点也不在乎我吗，强尼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you care about me at all, Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.72,1:09:52.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道你可以告诉我的 什么都可以跟我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you can talk to me. You can tell me anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.59,1:09:55.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.83,1:10:00.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正你也不会相信我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't believe me anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.17,1:10:05.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,试试看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.54,1:10:07.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会以为我是个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll think I'm crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.44,1:10:08.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我真的疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I am crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.08,1:10:10.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望我疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope I'm crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.48,1:10:13.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做这行见多识广 我什么奇怪的事情都遇见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my job, I've seen and heard just about everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.11,1:10:17.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么也吓不倒我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there is nothing you can tell me that's gonna surprise me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.45,1:10:19.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会录下来吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Off the record?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.89,1:10:22.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.63,1:10:36.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把我的灵魂卖给了魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sold my soul to the devil.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.98,1:10:46.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我得保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now I have to spare you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.11,1:10:49.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁会伤害我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spare me from what?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.42,1:10:51.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔，因为我为他工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}The devil, on account of I work for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.89,1:10:54.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我没办法赴晚餐的约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I couldn't make it to dinner.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.89,1:10:58.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你在为恶魔工作？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you were working for the devil?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.49,1:11:00.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的！我是他的赏金猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah. I'm his bounty hunter.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.73,1:11:04.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这只会在晚上发生，像现在那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it only happens at night, like it is right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.46,1:11:05.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要当我面对邪恶时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whenever I'm around evil.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.93,1:11:11.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶人，恶灵什么的 我就会变成…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evil people, evil spirits. I change into...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.74,1:11:13.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.01,1:11:19.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一只，一只怪物 不过我正在学习\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a great big monster, but I am learning to...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.18,1:11:22.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正在努力学习怎么控制它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting control of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.58,1:11:24.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正在尝试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.05,1:11:28.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以今晚，你也会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So tonight, you'll...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.96,1:11:32.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe so.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.33,1:11:35.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你应该…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why it's probably a very good idea...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.86,1:11:39.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该赶紧回去，罗珊\N{\fnArial\fs30}...that you run on home now, Roxie.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.54,1:11:44.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是认真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're serious.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.64,1:11:52.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你的解释？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is your excuse?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.15,1:11:57.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为过去？为昨晚？为所有的事情？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the past? For last night? For everything?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.93,1:12:10.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我现在有两种选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way I see it is I've got a couple of choices:
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.97,1:12:16.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一，我可以相信你，真的认为你跟我说的都是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could either accept that you really believe what you're telling me is true...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.30,1:12:18.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后把你带到最近的精神病院去\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and take you to the nearest psychiatric hospital.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.97,1:12:19.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看吧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, now that...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.17,1:12:24.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第二，我发现你宁可编个如此离谱的烂故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I realize that you'd rather make up ridiculous stories...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.58,1:12:26.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不愿意跟我说真话\N{\fnArial\fs30}...than be honest with me...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.28,1:12:29.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会走出这道门\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and I walk out of that door...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.98,1:12:31.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再也不回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}...forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.88,1:12:59.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 不许动！ - 把手举起来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't move! - Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.21,1:13:02.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手举过头顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands where we can see them! Right over your head.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.88,1:13:04.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爆火强尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny Blaze.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.62,1:13:06.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.02,1:13:11.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是杰克·多兰警官 这位是爱德华刑警\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Jack Dolan. This is Officer Edwards.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.83,1:13:14.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得跟我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're coming with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.13,1:13:17.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.70,1:13:24.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们再来一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's try this again.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.07,1:13:28.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在犯罪现场发现了你的车轮印\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have your plate and the tread from your tires at the crime scene.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.78,1:13:31.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有个证人可以作证…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a witness who will testify...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.24,1:13:33.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嫌疑犯使用某种火的效果\N{\fnArial\fs30}...that the suspect used some kind of fire effect.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.91,1:13:36.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种效果跟你的特技表演所用的是一样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}An effect just like the ones that you use in your stunt shows!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.15,1:13:41.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错，但我告诉你了，我没杀过任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. But I told you, I didn't kill anybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.46,1:13:52.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 这个人呢？你记得他吗？ - 不记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about him, you remember him? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.83,1:13:54.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个人三年以后就退休了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy was three years from retirement...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.87,1:13:56.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生前连一只苍蝇也没有伤害过\N{\fnArial\fs30}...never harmed a fly.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.40,1:13:58.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上，这些人都是在你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, neither did most of the corpses turning up...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.97,1:14:01.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回家之后死的，你这个狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}...since you came home, you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.41,1:14:04.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我没有杀人 - 胡说！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't kill anybody. - Bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.91,1:14:06.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧！我们放松一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's take a breather.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.38,1:14:11.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 这可真热 - 热？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's warm in here. - Warm?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.38,1:14:13.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都快着火了，你不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm burning up. Arert you?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.39,1:14:14.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有点\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.32,1:14:18.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要抽烟吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want a cigarette?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.23,1:14:20.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.13,1:14:22.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,介意我抽吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind if I do?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.27,1:14:29.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才太奇怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, that was weird.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.64,1:14:35.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着，强尼，我不是要你帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Johnny, I'm not asking for your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.21,1:14:39.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是要你帮你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm asking you to help yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.28,1:14:42.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我常看电视 我知道你们在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I watch a lot of TV and I know what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.38,1:14:47.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个扮白脸，一个扮黑脸 但你们两个都是好警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good cop, bad cop. But you're both good cops.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.82,1:14:51.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的服务对社会很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you provide a very, very important civil service.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.93,1:14:53.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实，我也想过在我的特技生涯结束后\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, when I finish my stunt career...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.99,1:14:57.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会利用我的技术成为一名摩托车巡警\N{\fnArial\fs30}...I intend to apply my skills to being a motorcycle policeman.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.63,1:15:01.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我很想帮你们 但我真的没杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'd love to help you. But I didn't kill anybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.84,1:15:03.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢，上帝！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.17,1:15:07.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想说服谁，强尼？ 我们还是你自己？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who you trying to convince, Johnny? Us or yourself?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.51,1:15:09.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在这尽力帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're trying to help you here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.48,1:15:12.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们尽力让这件事了无声息\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're trying to keep this thing quiet.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.71,1:15:16.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错，因为我认为你的粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, because I imagine that your fans wouldn't be too keen...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.32,1:15:19.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会希望你牵涉到谋杀案的调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}...on you being wrapped up in a homicide investigation.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.92,1:15:24.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更别提那些赞助商，活动主办者…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to mention all those corporate sponsors, event promoters...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.73,1:15:30.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在愿意说了吗？强尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready to talk now, Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.87,1:15:34.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则你就得在这过夜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or do you want to spend the night in the tank?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.10,1:15:37.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦，我可不想那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I don't wanna do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.74,1:15:41.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当然不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir. I sure don't wanna do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.24,1:15:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我没有杀任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I didn't kill anybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.68,1:15:48.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.82,1:15:53.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一定要放我走，真正的凶手正逍遥法外\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta let me go. The real killer's out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.79,1:15:57.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是谁啊 - 听着，你们搞错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lookie here. - But you're making a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.49,1:15:58.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看谁来了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What've we got?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.53,1:16:01.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, move your ass!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.73,1:16:08.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爆火强尼来看我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blaze, riding up to meet us.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.27,1:16:11.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦，天啊，求求你 你不会真想把我关在这吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. Oh, please. Please, you don't wanna put me in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.81,1:16:13.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉，五星级酒店都客满了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, the Ritz was booked.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.35,1:16:22.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天…拜托，快放我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. Please, get me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.92,1:16:26.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你长得很像那个爆火强尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like that Johnny Blaze.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.35,1:16:31.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的，常有人这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, I hear that a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.72,1:16:33.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不，你就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, that is you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.36,1:16:35.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 就是他！ - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's him! - Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.46,1:16:38.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我几年前去看过你的表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you jump in the state fair a few years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.87,1:16:41.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那时候我花了十块钱想看你脑浆四溅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I paid 10 bucks to watch you splatter.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.10,1:16:45.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.67,1:16:47.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来有人有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like somebody's tripping out.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.81,1:16:49.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你在外面是个名人，强尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might be a big shot out there, Blaze...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.98,1:16:52.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但在这里你只是一只被关在笼子里的猴子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}...but in here you're nothing but a monkey in a cage!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.91,1:16:54.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想惹麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I don't want any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.11,1:16:56.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想惹麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.18,1:16:59.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来是麻烦找上了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like trouble just found you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.09,1:17:02.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不错的外套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice jacket.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.72,1:17:05.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托，放过他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man, leave him alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.36,1:17:06.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.53,1:17:08.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 这外套是我的了 - 住手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The jacket's mine. - Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.53,1:17:45.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不错的外套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice jacket.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.70,1:17:49.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.29,1:18:10.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.76,1:18:13.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无罪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Innocent.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.63,1:18:49.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请原谅我，神父，我有罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me, Father, for I have sinned.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.07,1:18:53.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罪孽深重\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've sinned a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.12,1:19:18.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不许动！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.06,1:19:48.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（车库）
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.89,1:19:54.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（怒火）
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.29,1:19:57.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,圣凡冈萨的契约到底在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the contract of San Venganza?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.60,1:19:59.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you are talking about.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.73,1:20:05.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别想骗我，多年来你守护着它，保守秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't lie to me! You've been protecting it all these years, sworn to secrecy.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.20,1:20:07.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓会保密的，尤其是对你这种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sworn to keep it from the likes of you!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.98,1:20:12.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,古谚有云\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an old saying:
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.18,1:20:16.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,“千万不要养虎贻患”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Raise no more devils than you can lay down."
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.25,1:20:18.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我老爸养我就中计了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father raised one too many.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.46,1:20:28.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呼叫各小队，重刑犯逃往闹市区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calling all units. Reported 10-50 in the downtown area.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.20,1:20:30.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请小心警戒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proceed with caution.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.22,1:21:32.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他来抓我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's coming for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.06,1:21:34.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿比戈尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abigor.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.23,1:21:36.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.01,1:21:48.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rider.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.27,1:22:17.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发现嫌疑犯在樱桃街上向西驶去 重复，樱桃街，向西驶去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a suspect fleeing west on Cherry. Repeat, west on Cherry.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.80,1:22:21.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 那是条死巷子，你抓到他了 - 知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's a dead end. You got him. - 10-4 on that.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.75,1:22:29.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嫌疑犯现在的位置在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the suspect's location?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.45,1:22:30.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 上面 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Up. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.88,1:22:33.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嫌疑犯在往上走\N{\fnArial\fs30}The suspect is going up.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.44,1:22:54.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦，天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.96,1:23:10.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}People, help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.49,1:23:11.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快，快，快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.06,1:23:14.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,包围他！围成一圈！上！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surround him! Make a perimeter! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.34,1:23:27.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.45,1:23:43.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 过来！ - 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come here! - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.36,1:23:46.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你惹火我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're pissing me off.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.76,1:23:48.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好，好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.36,1:23:49.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.11,1:24:02.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靠右站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a right.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.22,1:24:13.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该加入我们的，骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've joined us, Rider.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.35,1:24:14.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们很快就能够找到那份契约了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon we will have the contract...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.09,1:24:19.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后，你会成为新地狱历史的脚注\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and then you'll only be a footnote in the history of the new hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.03,1:24:25.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该是清理空气的时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to clear the air.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.01,1:24:40.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是真笨还是假笨？骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a slow learner, aren't you, Rider?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.75,1:24:43.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是无法抓住风的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot catch the wind!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.13,1:24:58.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.13,1:25:34.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦，天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.97,1:26:11.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,强尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.84,1:26:19.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备开火！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare to fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.78,1:26:24.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 开火！ - 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fire! - Don't!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.38,1:27:31.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们知道我是谁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.25,1:27:34.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 谁知道了？ - 什么？所有的人啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's that? - What? Everybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.29,1:27:37.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你难道不看电视的？ 你这个人是怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't watch TV? What's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.39,1:27:43.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一切会结束吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this thing ever gonna end?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.33,1:27:45.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你抓到他的时候就结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lt'll end if you can catch him.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.80,1:27:47.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这到底是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's really going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.42,1:28:11.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 有什么好消息吗？ - 需要我效劳吗，警官？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anything good on? - How can I help you, captain?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.26,1:28:12.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.16,1:28:16.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们昨晚审讯你的一个朋友…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We brought a friend of yours in for questioning last night...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.03,1:28:19.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在他却不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and now he seems to have disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.00,1:28:22.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,强尼有以任何方法与你联络吗？女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has Johnny Blaze tried to contact you in any way, ma'am?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.14,1:28:25.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉，我帮不上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Can't help, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.61,1:28:33.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着，我不想假装了解发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't pretend to know what the hell that thing is...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.95,1:28:36.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我确实知道强尼与这事有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}...but I do know that Blaze is wrapped up in it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.58,1:28:41.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唯一能救他的方法就是你现在帮我们找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the only way you can save him now is if you help us find him.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.99,1:28:47.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你六个小时 否则我们就对外宣布我们所知的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got six hours. After that we go public with everything we got.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.73,1:28:50.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,六个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.98,1:29:06.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡特史雷？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Can'ter Slade."
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.65,1:29:12.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,传说中，他是德克萨斯州的巡警 一个很受人尊敬的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Legend has it he was a Texas Ranger. Man of honor.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.65,1:29:15.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他后来变的贪婪\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he got greedy.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.69,1:29:20.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果被抓了起来，等待绞刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found himself locked up, waiting on the gallows.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.96,1:29:22.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一天，有个陌生人来看他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stranger came to see him.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.36,1:29:25.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,承诺会给他自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Offering freedom.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.10,1:29:27.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,于是，他们做了交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slade made a deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.70,1:29:30.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他变成了灵魂骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ended up a Ghost Rider.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.14,1:29:32.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件事跟他有什么关系？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he gotta do with this?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.17,1:29:35.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记得我跟你说的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember that contract the stranger made...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.31,1:29:37.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,圣凡冈萨的契约吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}...with the people of San Venganza?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.04,1:29:42.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,传说后来，卡特史雷被派去收集那里的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}The story goes that Slade was sent there to collect all the souls.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.45,1:29:46.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他在那里所发现的灵魂太邪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what he found there was so evil...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.39,1:29:49.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,于是，他拿着契约书逃跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...that he took the contract and rode off.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.29,1:29:51.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他偷了契约？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stole it.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.32,1:29:55.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了不让“墨菲斯托菲里斯（万魔王）”得到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep Mephistopheles from getting his hands on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.06,1:29:58.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人说那份契约已经被他带进棺材了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some people say he was buried with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.00,1:30:01.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 是吗？ - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Was he? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.40,1:30:07.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我知道，黑心魔一定会来 他会不惜一切的得到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I do know is that Blackheart is coming, and he'll do anything to get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.81,1:30:11.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你一定要远离亲戚和朋友…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why it's important for you to stay away from friends and family...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.94,1:30:14.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,任何他能用来对付你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}...anybody he can use against you, because he will.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.25,1:30:16.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗姗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roxanne.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.43,1:30:28.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,强尼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.83,1:30:36.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,强尼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.27,1:30:37.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}God!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.24,1:30:40.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起！对不起！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry! Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.01,1:30:42.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女士，你吓了我一跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, you gave me a start.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.08,1:30:46.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我在找强尼 - 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm looking for Johnny. - Yeah. You and me both.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.25,1:30:49.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 他有没有跟你联系？ - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have you heard from him? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.25,1:30:51.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我听说他有麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I heard he got in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.52,1:30:55.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他被捕了吧？怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got arrested, yeah? What for?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.92,1:30:59.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗？如果这件事传到媒体那里 他的前途就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, if this gets out in the press, his career is over.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.66,1:31:02.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我，他的前途不算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, trust me, his career's the least of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.83,1:31:05.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗？你是个好人，长得也很漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you seem like a nice lady, and you're pretty and all...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.90,1:31:08.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我们原本一切顺风如意\N{\fnArial\fs30}...but we were riding the gravy train on biscuit wheels...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.63,1:31:10.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自从你来了之后就衰事不断\N{\fnArial\fs30}...then you showed up, everything went to hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.87,1:31:13.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以，可不可以请你从哪来回哪去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why don't you go back to wherever it is you came from?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.47,1:31:16.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能回去，至少目前不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't go back. Not now.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.88,1:31:19.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就请你告诉我到底发生了什么事！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then tell me what the hell's going on!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.55,1:31:23.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了你也不会信的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't believe me if I told you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.65,1:31:26.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着，你不了解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you don't know me...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.49,1:31:27.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我爱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}...but I love him.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.82,1:31:32.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以，如果你有任何可以帮上忙的线索 任何东西…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if there's anything you know that can help, anything...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.09,1:31:37.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近他常看一些奇怪的书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lately, he's been reading these really weird books...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.90,1:31:39.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些书把他搞的怪怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and they're messing with his mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.80,1:31:43.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且他还做笔记，经常熬夜 他，他就在那里做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's writing stuff down and staying up late. And he does it over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.80,1:31:46.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以翻翻看他的东西 但我不知道那有些什么意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can go through this stuff, and I don't know if it means anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.06,1:32:41.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是圣地\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is hallowed ground.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.30,1:32:52.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我和其他人一样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you think I was like the others?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.34,1:32:57.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我拥有我父亲的全部力量 但没有他的一项弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have all of my father's strengths and none of his weaknesses.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.38,1:33:01.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新的地狱在圣凡冈萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}The new hell is in San Venganza.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.25,1:33:05.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要那份契约\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need the contract.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.72,1:33:07.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道它在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.53,1:33:15.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在把它交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.50,1:33:27.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.01,1:33:30.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.08,1:33:33.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it to me. Give it to me. Give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.19,1:33:51.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一定会失败的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna fall.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.76,1:33:53.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像你父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.36,1:34:23.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个骑士，他在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Rider, where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.03,1:34:25.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gone!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.84,1:34:31.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.30,1:34:35.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要是伤害她，他就会像风暴前的闪电 那样出现在你面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hurt her, he'll be there like lightning before the storm.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.18,1:34:40.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正合我意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm counting on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.49,1:34:49.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗姗在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Roxanne?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.79,1:34:51.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计，你去哪了？大家都在找…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude. Where've you been? Everybody's out looking...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.16,1:34:55.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 她在哪里？ - 她找你去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is she? - She's out looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.31,1:35:15.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.65,1:35:17.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even close.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.29,1:35:26.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你拥有他的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have his heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.23,1:35:34.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我要弄碎它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm gonna break it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.67,1:35:37.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗姗！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roxanne?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.28,1:35:44.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mack.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.31,1:35:48.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,罗珊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roxanne.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.42,1:35:59.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着我的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look into my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.77,1:36:09.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的忏悔之眼对我不起作用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Penance Stare doesn't work on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.40,1:36:11.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我没有灵魂可以让你烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no soul to burn.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.21,1:36:16.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的监护人忘了跟你说了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess the Caretaker forgot to mention that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.61,1:36:17.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃惊吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.58,1:36:20.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他让你把我抓回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sent you to bring me back.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.95,1:36:22.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不想回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going back.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.98,1:36:24.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like it here.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.25,1:36:30.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他竟然会认为你能比的过我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thinks you're better than me?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.22,1:36:33.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真不知道是谁比较可悲 你，还是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know who's more pathetic, you or him.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.36,1:36:40.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着，希望你那骷髅脑袋可以记住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, listen to me. And try to get it through that thick skull of yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.67,1:36:44.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从现在起，你不再听命于我父亲 而是帮我做事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't work for my father anymore. You work for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.50,1:36:46.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从你监护人那里把契约拿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the contract from the Caretaker.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.91,1:36:51.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿到圣凡冈萨来给我 我也许会饶你女朋友一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it to me in San Venganza and maybe I'll spare your girl's life.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.51,1:36:53.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有，强尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, Johnny...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.82,1:37:00.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别让我等太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...don't make me wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.24,1:37:20.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.54,1:37:24.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 是黑心魔 - 他们抓走了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Blackheart. - They got her.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.11,1:37:27.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那契约在哪里？ 没有它我没办法了结此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the contract? I can't end this without it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.82,1:37:33.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧，那我就把这里都挖一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just gonna have to dig this whole damn place up myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.76,1:37:38.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不在那里， 孩子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not there, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.24,1:37:52.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,圣凡冈萨的契约\N{\fnArial\fs30}Contract of San Venganza.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.64,1:37:54.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人间地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell on earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.58,1:37:58.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得信任我才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you're gonna have to trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.31,1:38:00.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.91,1:38:03.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他也许拥有我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}He may have my soul...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.28,1:38:07.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过他并没有我的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}...but he doesn't have my spirit.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.26,1:38:17.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,任何有胆量为爱出卖灵魂的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any man who's got the guts to sell his soul for love...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.33,1:38:19.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都拥有改变世界的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}...got the power to change the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.57,1:38:22.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,驱策你的不是贪婪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't do it for greed.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.14,1:38:25.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是正当的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it for the right reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.00,1:38:27.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许那能让上帝站在你这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe that puts God on your side.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.81,1:38:30.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对他来说，那让你更形成威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}To him, that makes you dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.18,1:38:33.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,令你无可预测\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes you unpredictable.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.81,1:38:36.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这对你来说是最好不过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the best thing you can be right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.12,1:38:42.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,圣凡冈萨距离这里有500英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}San Venganza's 500 miles from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.59,1:38:45.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得快点出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}We better get moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.66,1:38:48.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We"?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.98,1:39:13.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我应该还可以骑最后一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got one last ride left in me.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.33,1:39:26.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡特史雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can'ter Slade.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.07,1:39:32.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟得上吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you keep up?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.35,1:39:42.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出发吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's ride.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.46,1:40:29.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记得要呆在暗处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stick to the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.58,1:40:50.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我最后一次变身\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the end of the trail for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.65,1:40:52.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的能量已耗尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.15,1:40:56.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只能再变身一次 而我等待的就是这一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could only change one more time, and I was saving it for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.63,1:41:04.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上天知道我犯了多少错\N{\fnArial\fs30}God knows I've made my share of mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.80,1:41:08.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直想改正我犯的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been trying to make things right ever since.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.93,1:41:14.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我也只能希望 上天愿给我第二次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess all I can do now is hope he sees fit to give me a second chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.21,1:41:16.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.74,1:41:18.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.54,1:41:20.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你，孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.86,1:41:37.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骑士要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Rider is coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.83,1:41:41.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要来救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming to save you.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.43,1:41:45.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为你可以阻止他？ 没有人可以阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you can stop him? Nothing can stop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.07,1:41:48.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他时间不够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.94,1:41:50.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.51,1:41:57.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快要黎明了，让他慢下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's almost dawn. Slow him down.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.65,1:42:05.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么？ - 让他慢..下..来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Slow him down.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.17,1:43:23.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,惊奇吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.98,1:44:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.31,1:44:41.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你变身，她就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You change, she dies.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.08,1:44:44.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快变身，强尼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.39,1:44:53.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先让她走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her go first.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.05,1:45:52.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来你没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you're out of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.52,1:46:27.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是圣凡冈萨的契约\N{\fnArial\fs30}"This is the contract of San Venganza.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.12,1:46:32.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灵魂们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.22,1:46:35.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都来我这里吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}...come to me!"
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.78,1:47:32.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,强尼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.30,1:47:50.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的名字是“群魔”\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Legion...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.54,1:47:54.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}...for we are...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.74,1:47:59.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为数众多\N{\fnArial\fs30}...many.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.15,1:48:03.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧，他已经得到他想要的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. He got what he wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.18,1:48:10.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你先走，我得到暗处去 我得结束这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go. I gotta get him to the shadows. I gotta end this.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.46,1:48:13.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么？为什么是你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Why you?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.42,1:48:16.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从我订下契约的那天就已经注定了是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been me since the day I made the deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.46,1:48:19.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有我能够同时存在于两个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the only one who can walk in both worlds.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.90,1:48:21.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是灵魂骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Ghost Rider.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.87,1:48:26.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快跑！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.52,1:48:38.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来啊，你这混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.57,1:49:02.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of your world...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.04,1:49:04.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}...all of your souls...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.08,1:49:07.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在都是我的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...will be mine now.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.13,1:49:23.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 把枪扔过来！ - 没子弹了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Throw me the gun! - It's out!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.43,1:49:26.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扔过来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw it!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.99,1:50:28.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有那么多恶灵在你身体里是什么感觉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does it feel to have all that evil inside of you?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.56,1:50:29.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}All their power.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.13,1:50:33.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}All their souls.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.00,1:50:36.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上千个灵魂等着燃烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thousand souls to burn.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.63,1:50:39.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着我的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look into my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.40,1:50:42.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的灵魂被无辜者的鲜血所污染\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your souls are stained by the blood of the innocent.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.14,1:50:44.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.18,1:50:46.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感受他们的痛苦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel their pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.06,1:51:00.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,圣父、圣子和圣灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, the Son and the Holy Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:00.59,1:51:01.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我宰了你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill you!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.40,1:51:06.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.13,1:51:10.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦，天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.88,1:51:52.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monster.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:53.71,1:51:55.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.34,1:52:22.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜你，强尼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations, Johnny.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:23.94,1:52:26.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经完成了你的约定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You upheld your end of the bargain.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.85,1:52:31.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我该拿回属于灵魂骑士的力量了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time I take back the power of the Ghost Rider.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:32.15,1:52:33.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以回去过你自己的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get your life back.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.89,1:52:36.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得到了你一直想要的真爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The love you've always wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.19,1:52:39.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以建立自己的家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can start a family of your own.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.66,1:52:42.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世上多的是交易可谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are more deals to be made.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.33,1:52:47.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有很多人愿意拿灵魂换取欲望\N{\fnArial\fs30}More people willing to give their souls for what they desire.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.33,1:52:52.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让别人去承受这个诅咒吧 你自由了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let someone else carry this curse. You're free now.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.44,1:52:54.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.67,1:52:57.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说话要算话\N{\fnArial\fs30}...a deal's a deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:10.55,1:53:11.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.42,1:53:15.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要拥有这个诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna own this curse...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.19,1:53:19.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并且用它来对付你\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and I'm gonna use it against you.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.56,1:53:23.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每当无辜者被牺牲时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whenever innocent blood is spilt...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.70,1:53:26.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会以父亲之名\N{\fnArial\fs30}...it'll be my father's blood...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.81,1:53:30.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出现在你面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and you'll find me there.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.54,1:53:32.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,复仇之魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}A spirit of vengeance...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:33.54,1:53:36.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以火焰对抗火焰\N{\fnArial\fs30}...fighting fire with fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.92,1:53:40.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会让你付出代价的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will make you pay for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:41.59,1:53:43.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能活在恐惧中\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't live in fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.62,1:53:47.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:10.98,1:54:13.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where will you go now?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.69,1:54:17.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,命运安排我去哪里就去哪里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wherever the road takes me, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:21.13,1:54:25.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸曾说过:“不主导命运，就会被命运牵着走”\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daddy once said, "If you don't make a choice, the choice makes you."
Dialogue: 0,1:54:25.50,1:54:29.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗？但为什么你的选择总是让我们分开？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. But why do your choices always keep us apart?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.65,1:54:45.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真希望这一切都不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure wish things could have turned out different.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.38,1:54:50.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不，这就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. This is what you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.55,1:54:53.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你该做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what you always were meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.96,1:54:55.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经得到了第二次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got your second chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.23,1:54:58.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好珍惜它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go out there and make the best of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:09.84,1:55:11.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（强尼罗珊永远相爱）
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.82,1:55:30.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据说西部是建立在传说上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's said that the West was built on legends...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:31.70,1:55:34.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而传说协助我们解读\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and that legends are a way of understanding...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:34.43,1:55:36.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比我们更伟大的事物\N{\fnArial\fs30}...things greater than ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.37,1:55:39.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,影响我们命运的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forces that shape our lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.84,1:55:43.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难以解释的事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Events that defy explanation.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.34,1:55:48.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,升上天堂的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Individuals whose lives soar to the heavens...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.21,1:55:50.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坠入凡间的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}...or fall to the earth.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:50.65,1:55:54.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,传说就是这样诞生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how legends are born.
